WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,550
Can you afford to support so many people?

2
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:19,300
Ten mouths, these are all harsh wishes that urge you to die.

3
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:32,329
Please help me with one thing

4
00:00:32,329 --> 00:00:39,775
After the trial is completed

5
00:00:39,775 --> 00:00:47,220
I let you live
